{"parentUuid":"15991162-33a8-459d-bf61-e11b0b918ca9","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"f51e2112-0260-44ed-9b89-c69d1eac8b4d","agentId":"ae649ce7dcad97197","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GuFNj5xByNb3sSkVHAYk8G","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"SideFX HIVE talk Copernicus texturing procedural materials 2025 Houdini 21 \"Copernicus\" talk texture\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"join epc 2025 for in person hands on houdini training talks\",\"url\":\"https://80.lv/articles/join-epc-2025-for-in-person-hands-on-houdini-training-talks\"},{\"title\":\"join epc 2025 for in person hands on houdini training talks\",\"url\":\"https://origin.80.lv/articles/join-epc-2025-for-in-person-hands-on-houdini-training-talks\"},{\"title\":\"Don't Run from COPs | Nikola Damjanov | Houdini 20.5 HIVE Paris\",\"url\":\"https://vimeo.com/970685082\"},{\"title\":\"see how houdini 20 5 s new cops handle npr rendering\",\"url\":\"https://80.lv/articles/see-how-houdini-20-5-s-new-cops-handle-npr-rendering\"},{\"title\":\"Look Development\",\"url\":\"https://www.sidefx.com/ja/learn/learning-paths/lookdev/copernicus/\"},{\"title\":\"Look Development\",\"url\":\"https://www.sidefx.com/learn/learning-paths/lookdev/copernicus/\"},{\"title\":\"www.sidefx.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.sidefx.com/forum/topic/96472/?page=2\"},{\"title\":\"www.sidefx.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.sidefx.com/forum/post/424796\"},{\"title\":\"Day 8 | Texture: COPS | STONE | Image\",\"url\":\"https://www.sidefx.com/forum/post/439783\"}]\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"www.sidefx.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.sidefx.com/ja/products/houdini/lookdev/copernicus/\"},{\"title\":\"www.sidefx.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.sidefx.com/products/houdini/lookdev/copernicus/\"},{\"title\":\"pbr texturing in copernicus\",\"url\":\"https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/pbr-texturing-in-copernicus/\"},{\"title\":\"Don't Run from COPs\",\"url\":\"https://www.sidefx.com/learn/talks/dont-run-from-cops\"},{\"title\":\"All Posts tagged “PBR\",\"url\":\"https://entagma.com/tag/pbr\"},{\"title\":\"New in Houdini 21: PBR Texturing in Copernicus (updated workflow)\",\"url\":\"https://entagma.com/?p=6468\"},{\"title\":\"www.sidefx.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/unreal/copernicus.html\"},{\"title\":\"All Posts tagged “houdini 21\",\"url\":\"https://entagma.com/tag/houdini-21\"},{\"title\":\"building a substance like texturing workflow in copernicus\",\"url\":\"https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/building-a-substance-like-texturing-workflow-in-copernicus/\"},{\"title\":\"Houdini 21.0 Unreal\",\"url\":\"https://www.sidefx.com/ja/docs/houdini/unreal/copernicus.html\"}]\n\nI couldn't find a specific 2025 HIVE talk titled around Copernicus texturing. The closest matches are a 2025 conference that included Copernicus texturing content and an earlier HIVE talk on the same topic.\n\n**2025 Everything Procedural Conference:** SideFX took part in this event, which ran April 22-25 in Breda and included HIVE presentations. All textures will be crafted using Houdini's new Copernicus framework in one of the in-person workshops. The same event's workshop sessions also covered how Copernicus simplifies complex photogrammetry workflows. I didn't find the individual HIVE talk list, so I can't confirm a Copernicus texturing talk in that lineup.\n\n**\"Don't Run from COPs\" (HIVE Paris, Houdini 20.5):** This talk by Nikola Damjanov is the most direct match. It focuses on the ability to author procedural textures in Copernicus, with a couple of detailed examples. Note that it targets Houdini 20.5, not 21.\n\n**Houdini 21 Copernicus texturing resources:** SideFX says Houdini 21 brings new workflows to Copernicus aimed at texturing. Texture building uses nodes such as Tile Pattern or SDF Shapes. For a Houdini 21 walkthrough, Entagma's video creates the so called \"Detroid Agate\", a procedural texture built in COPs.\n\nIf you want to find the exact 2025 talk, I'd check the Side